{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 42494,
	"Name": "Farmer Portraits by Ncyde",
	"Author": "Ncyde",
	"Description": "[center][/center][center][img]https://i.imgur.com/jYVOSS1.jpeg[/img]\n<br />[img]https://i.imgur.com/6n65jKP.jpeg[/img]\uFEFF\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[color=#a4c2f4][size=6][b]Farmer Portraits by Ncyde\uFEFF\n<br />\n<br />[/b][/size][/color][b][color=#b6d7a8][size=4]INSTALLATION / HOW TO USE:\n<br />[/size][/color][/b]\n<br />[b][color=#ffe599](1) [/color][/b]- Download Farmer Portraits 1.6 and its requirements and install it normally (put the Farmer Portraits folder in /mods)\n<br />[b][color=#ffe599](2)[/color][/b] Download my mod and put the\u00A0[CP] Farmer Portraits by Ncyde in /mods. NOT IN THE SAME FOLDER as Farmer Portraits, they have to be in separated folders.\n<br />[color=#f9cb9c][b](3)[/b][/color] Enjoy! :D\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#ea9999][size=4]IMPORTANT:\n<br />[/size][/color][/b]\n<br />[size=4][b][color=#ea9999]To get emotions working[/color][/b] you have to open config.json in Mods/FarmerPortraits and change the line PortraitReactions from False to True.[/size]\n<br />[b]If you dont have a text editor,[u] I left in the optional files a config.json ready that you can download and replace with the one in Mods/Farmerportraits[/u].[/b]\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[b][color=#d5a6bd][size=3]EXTRA TIPS:\n<br />[/size][/color][/b]\n<br />Since you can only have one set of portraits at a time, if you want to change between portraits you just have to replace the images in Mods/[CP] Farmer Portraits by Ncyde/Assets to the set that you want to use.\n<br />\n<br />For immersion reasons, all my portraits will have clothes that are actually in the game (except for characters from other franchises). I always play with a tank top, to get it since day one you can open the SMAPI console (normally it opens with\u00A0~) and paste this:\n<br />[b]For Male tank top:\u00A0[color=#ff7700]debug shirt 1129[/color]\n<br />For Female tank top:\u00A0[color=#ff00ff]debug shirt 1130[/color][/b]\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[color=#ffe599][size=5][b]FUTURE PLANS:\u00A0\n<br />[/b][/size][/color][size=3]If this mods gets a lot of support and endorsements I would love to keep doing more and more characters with all kind of different looks. And even make characters from other franchises :D\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[/size][b][color=#b4a7d6][size=5]RECOMENDED MODS:\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[/size]Male Portraits (All Males Included)[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/42965]\n<br />[img]https://i.imgur.com/mLwtLz6.jpeg[/img]\n<br />\n<br />[/size]Bachelorette Portraits[/url][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/25337]\n<br />[img]https://i.imgur.com/ylRBnnR.png[/img]\n<br />\n<br />[/url]Female Portraits\n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/30258?tab=description][img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1303/images/30258/30258-1734885471-408663694.png[/img]\n<br />[/url]\uFEFF\uFEFF[/color][/b]\n<br />\uFEFF\n<br />[/center]",
